\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 I. Executive Summary
\f1\b0\fs28 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 LBServerWiFi v1.8.0 is a high-performance WiFi-to-LocoNet bridge designed for the ESP32 microcontroller. It enables model railroad control software, such as JMRI, to communicate with a LocoNet network over a TCP/IP connection. The defining advancement of version 1.8.0 is the transition to a fully asynchronous background logging architecture, which ensures that diagnostic output never interferes with time-critical LocoNet packet timing or network stability.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

